Nexus-authored run-mode regression inputs
  nexus_argon_scf.in       self-consistent field calculation
  nexus_h2_relax.in        ionic relaxation
  nexus_argon_bands.in     band-structure path calculation
  nexus_hubbard_e2_e3.in   Hubbard B, E2, and E3 parameters

These four files are original Nexus test fixtures and were not adapted from
the Quantum ESPRESSO example inputs.

